Add pam_faceauth.so module (draft for https://github.com/SUSE/pam-config)

pam_faceauth (https://github.com/gvarsanyi/faceauth) provides face
authentication. It goes into the auth stack as "sufficient" before
pam_unix; every non-success result is PAM_AUTHINFO_UNAVAIL, so the stack
falls through to the password. Supports the module's timeout= option.

Based on pam-config 7ab3c20 (2026-02-16). Not compiled yet.
